@startuml
!theme plain
actor User
participant "Unified Web" as Web
participant "SSO API" as API
participant "OIDC Provider" as IdP
database PostgreSQL as DB

User -> Web: Sign in with institution SSO
Web -> API: start(connection, redirect URI)
API -> IdP: discovery document
API -> DB: hashed state + nonce + PKCE verifier
API --> Web: authorization URL
Web -> IdP: authorize + PKCE challenge
IdP --> Web: code + state
Web -> API: callback(code, state)
API -> DB: verify single-use state
API -> IdP: code exchange + PKCE verifier
IdP --> API: signed ID token
API -> IdP: retrieve JWKS
API -> API: verify signature, issuer, audience, expiry, nonce
API -> DB: resolve federated subject or explicitly allowed verified-email link
API --> Web: one-time handoff + available roles
Web -> API: handoff + selected role
API -> DB: validate active membership and role\nconsume handoff\ncreate application session
API --> Web: access + refresh tokens
@enduml
